Software Components:
===================
OS - Operating System: Core software managing hardware, UI, and software interactions. eg: Windows, macOS, Linux
Device Drivers - OS <-> Hardware bridge: Allows the OS to communicate with hardware components such as GPU or printer drivers.
Firmware - Embedded Software: Permanent software embedded into hardware (like BIOS). Manages low-level startup operations.
Applications - User-facing software: Programs for user tasks - word processors, web browsers, games, security tools.
